<section class="specs">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Industrial scope</span>
        <h2>Built for the kind of jobs<br/>most painters say no to.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <p class="lede">Sectors and surfaces we cover. If you're not on this list, ring us anyway — we usually know someone who can.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="specs-grid">
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">01 · Surface</span>
        <h4>Steel &amp; structural</h4>
        <p>Beams, columns, awnings, gantries. Rust converters, zinc primers, two-pack topcoats.</p>
        <span class="tick">Hot-dip ready</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">02 · Surface</span>
        <h4>Concrete &amp; epoxy floors</h4>
        <p>Warehouse, workshop, food-grade. Diamond grind, vapour-barrier prime, anti-slip and water-resistant epoxy systems.</p>
        <span class="tick">Food-grade OK</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">03 · Surface</span>
        <h4>Factory &amp; shed roofs</h4>
        <p>Colorbond, zincalume, asbestos-encapsulation. Thermal-reflective topcoats to cool the building.</p>
        <span class="tick">Heat-reflective</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">04 · Surface</span>
        <h4>Tank &amp; vessel exterior</h4>
        <p>Bulk storage, silos, fuel tanks. Inhibitor primers, UV-stable topcoats, full re-line on schedule.</p>
        <span class="tick">UV stable</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">05 · Service</span>
        <h4>Line marking</h4>
        <p>Carpark bays, warehouse aisles, safety zones. Crisp, hard-wearing acrylic and 2-pack lines.</p>
        <span class="tick">AS-compliant</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">06 · Service</span>
        <h4>Mould &amp; corrosion</h4>
        <p>Cyclone-zone environments don't forgive shortcuts. High-pressure water cleaning, lead paint removal, then we treat, prime, and topcoat to last.</p>
        <span class="tick">Cyclone-zone</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">07 · Service</span>
        <h4>Heights &amp; access</h4>
        <p>EWP, scaffold and ladder access — even the hard-to-reach areas, after hours, public holidays and weekends.</p>
        <span class="tick">After hours &amp; weekends</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spec">
        <span class="num">08 · Service</span>
        <h4>Asbestos awareness</h4>
        <p>Encapsulation systems for confirmed-low-risk roofs. We refer the rest to a licensed remover.</p>
        <span class="tick">Encapsulation</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

